'''Marlon''' (Japanese: '''シズイ''' ''Shizui'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Heal 70 damage from 1 of your {{TCGP|Carracosta}} or {{TCGP|Jellicent}}.
